<v Muhammad Kamran>She's like, she has knowledge of the world as well as the religions. So she's saying that-- very, very cute-looking. So I'm going to ask her right now if she can cook and stuff. [SPEAKING ARABIC]
<v Muhammad Kamran>她觉得她既有世俗知识，又有宗教修养。所以她说——长得非常、非常可爱。所以我现在要问她会不会做饭之类的。（阿拉伯语交流）

